# Type: flow / decision. Diamonds ask a question, edge labels answer it.
# Two branches sharing one end node force a crossing; give each branch its own end nodes instead.
direction: down

title: 期权到期日的行权决策 {shape: text; near: top-center; style.font-size: 20}

start: 到期日 Expiry {shape: oval}
q1: 看涨还是看跌? {shape: diamond}
qc: S_T > X ? {shape: diamond}
qp: S_T < X ? {shape: diamond}
cx: 行权 exercise\n收益 S_T − X {class: good}
cl: 放弃 lapse\n损失 = 期权费 {class: muted}
px: 行权 exercise\n收益 X − S_T {class: good}
pl: 放弃 lapse\n损失 = 期权费 {class: muted}

start -> q1
q1 -> qc: call
q1 -> qp: put
qc -> cx: 是 ITM {class: pos}
qc -> cl: 否 {class: weak}
qp -> px: 是 ITM {class: pos}
qp -> pl: 否 {class: weak}
